<section class="story" id="story">
  <div class="wrap story-in">
    <div>
      <h2>{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
      {{ section.settings.text_1 }}
      {{ section.settings.text_2 }}
      {{ section.settings.text_3 }}
      <p class="sign">{{ section.settings.sign }}</p>
    </div>
    {%- if section.settings.image -%}
      <img src="{{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 1200 }}" alt="Shurmble story" />
    {%- else -%}
      <img src="{{ 'story-baker.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Cartoon illustration of a smiling baker holding a tall stack of three giant chocolate chip cookies" />
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Our story",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Spreading Happiness One Cookie at A Time" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "text_1", "label": "Paragraph 1", "default": "<p>Who would've thought that a tiny dorm-room oven would become one of Pakistan's fastest-growing cookie businesses?</p>" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "text_2", "label": "Paragraph 2", "default": "<p>It all started in a student kitchen in Islamabad, where a passion for baking turned into something bigger. In the beginning, it was nothing more than a humble tray of cookies shared with friends, teachers and anyone who walked past and caught the smell. Within no time, the soon-to-be-famous Shurmble cookies started getting the attention they deserved.</p>" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "text_3", "label": "Paragraph 3", "default": "<p>As the orders grew, we took a leap of faith and moved into a small commercial kitchen. That was the moment Shurmble was born — officially! Today, Shurmble caters to a wide sweet-tooth customer base with nationwide delivery, baking every batch fresh, thick and stuffed to the brim.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sign", "label": "Sign-off", "default": "Warmly, The Shurmble Family" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Story image (leave empty to use the demo baker illustration)" }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Our story", "category": "Shurmble" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
